sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)
    participant FE as Frontend (React)

    Note over BE,DB: Creation -- triggered internally by other actions (never a direct user request)
    Note over BE: e.g. vacancy_interviewer_assigned, interview_scheduled, feedback_reminder, stage_changed
    BE->>BE: notifyUser(userId, type, payload)
    BE->>DB: Create Notification {userId, type, payload, isRead: false}

    Note over User,DB: Viewing notifications
    User->>FE: Open notification bell / panel
    FE->>BE: GET /api/notifications
    BE->>DB: findMany Notification where userId = current user, order by createdAt desc
    BE-->>FE: 200 list of notifications
    FE-->>User: Render list, unread count badge

    Note over User,DB: Marking as read
    User->>FE: Click a notification, or "Mark all as read"
    alt single notification
        FE->>BE: PATCH /api/notifications/:id/read
        BE->>DB: Update Notification.isRead = true (only if it belongs to current user)
    else mark all
        FE->>BE: PATCH /api/notifications/read-all
        BE->>DB: Update all of current user's unread Notifications to isRead = true
    end
    BE-->>FE: 200 updated
